  "policy": "Reference hashes identify the exact published inputs; SDK files retain local patches and Apache-2.0 notices and are not byte-identical upstream copies.",
  "local_changes": [
    "Preserve the public base ABI and SDK input validation, secure wipes, allocation and extraction size limits.",
    "Integrate Zupt archive format 1.6, integrity trailers, atomic publication, dedup and disk validation.",
    "Use the Zupt level-to-codec mapping, checksum policy and decode-plus-compare acceptance check.",
    "Retain the Zupt encoder entropy workspace reserve and scalar portability adjustments.",
    "Initialize CPU features once for SDK AUTO and SHA-NI dispatch.",
    "Suppress successful CLI output in the SDK and retain aggregate extraction quotas.",
    "Expose a default-off trusted legacy no-AIT read option through ZUPTSDK_1.2.",
    "Preserve local ML-KEM modulus validation and secret wiping and Keccak state wiping.",
    "Apply the copyright owner Apache-2.0 grant; preserve BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause and CC0-1.0 terms."
  ],
